{"id":1745587,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:36.748Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745587,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Keliru Ibu","overview":"# Story of Raykal  Raykal has two young children who love to listen to their father tell stories. Raykal tells them about several of his mothers when he was young. Raykal was around ten years old at that time. He was cared for and raised by two women. One he called 'mama' and the other he called 'bonda'. Bonda was his adoptive mother with a strong and fierce attitude. Meanwhile, mama was his wet nurse with a passive, negative attitude and prone to sulking. Raykal grew up with one passive mother and one aggressive mother. This sometimes caused Raykal to become confused, making it difficult for him to make the right decisions. Nevertheless, Raykal was able to make both his mothers proud because he succeeded brilliantly at university. One day, a woman came looking for Raykal. It was only then that Raykal discovered that this woman was actually his biological mother who had been imprisoned for 20 years due to being a drug mule.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/pwxSj4xbWB1HdP73syUYL6606et.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":86291,"logo_path":null,"name":"Cinestage Productions","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Keliru Ibu","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2413156,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Haris Ismail","original_name":"Haris Ismail","popularity":0.4928,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7683ddf1ac25fe1f4d6278","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1326698,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Sherie Merlis